  "description": "<ul></ul>\r\n<p>Alfie&rsquo;s Treatos is a premium Australian brand dedicated to crafting high-quality, single-ingredient seafood dog treats. Inspired by our love for dogs and their health, we create treats that are natural, nutritious, and packed with the goodness of sustainably sourced Australian and New Zealand seafood.</p>\r\n<p>Our treats include a range of air-dried sardines, green-lipped mussels, salmon skin, and prawns &ndash; all rich in omega-3 fatty acids for healthy coats, joints, and overall vitality. Each product is made using a gentle air-drying process to preserve maximum nutrients and flavor without additives or preservatives. Perfect as training treats, meal toppers, or everyday rewards.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>100% Natural Ingredients</strong>: No fillers, additives, or preservatives.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Rich in Omega-3</strong>: Promotes shiny coats, joint health, and overall well-being.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Australian &amp; NZ Sourced</strong>: Sustainably harvested seafood.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Air-Dried to Perfection</strong>: Locks in nutrients and flavor, unlike freeze-dried or heavily processed treats.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Ideal for All Dogs</strong>: Crunchy textures and irresistible flavors that dogs love.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><br></p>",
